WEBVTT

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.250
Dearia, I'm in trouble!

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.500
Oh?

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.290
I had all this the money I'd saved up
for our house-hunting journey...

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.670
But then I had to get food for Pip,

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:52.010
and buy cold medicine,

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:53.260
and then...

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:52.250
Top Quality Imported Snow

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:52.340
Top Quality Imported Snow

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:53.340
Top Quality Imported Snow

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:57.970
I imported a bunch of snow for Pip...

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.430
Now I'm flat broke!

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:05.440
My baby tooth fund is gone!

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:08.070
I see. I know just the thing:

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:10.440
We'll spend today earning you some money.

