{=6}Dragon Goes Job-Hunting

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:20.160
They're changing the name of the show!

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.040
Thank you, gentlemen.
I'll call you when I need you again.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.420
Financial assets are necessary
both to purchase a home

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:32.510
and to take proper care of your son.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:35.760
Now is a grand time for you
to earn yourself those assets.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.600
R-Right! I'll work really hard!

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:43.680
But are there even jobs that
would want to hire a dragon?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.690
Yes, plenty.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.400
Dragons are always in very high demand.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.320
In the market, that is.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:54.740
For what?! That can't be good!

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.820
Time to fast travel.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:07.960
Th...

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:11.420
There are tons of humans here!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:16.840
This free city does not persecute anyone
on the basis of species or nationality.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:20.180
As such, all manner of beings
come here to trade.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:25.140
Some merchants sell your typical fare
of weapons, defense items, and potions,

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.480
while others sell forbidden tomes,
illicit substances, and powerful charms.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:33.980
{=9}We've got 'em!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:33.980
{=8}Great for killing with curses!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:33.980
{=7}You need this in your home!!

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:34.440
Stolen and illegally smuggled goods
make up for the bulk of their wares.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:38.030
So this marketplace is really just
a wretched hive of scum and villainy...

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:42.410
Yes, I suppose you could
describe it that way.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.160
Where there are people, there are jobs.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:50.130
Noooo!

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:52.210
Welcome!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.840
What would you like to buy?

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.840
How about a nice <i>dragon</i>?!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.680
And then they'll attack me!
I can't do this!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:04.770
Combat, thievery, and larceny
are all prohibited in this marketplace.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:07.100
You have nothing to fear. Probably.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.350
"Probably"?!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.310
If even Heroes break the rules...

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.360
...they're jailed.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.150
Why are there so many?

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:24.330
Most likely they accidentally
pressed the "Steal" button.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:24.410
Talk

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:24.410
Fight

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:24.410
Buy

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:24.410
Sell

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:24.410
Steal

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:24.410
examine

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.660
Why does it even prompt them to do that?

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.660
Stop, thief!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.160
It's just part of being a Hero.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.460
A dragon!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:34.880
What do they do with them
after they jail them?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:39.550
Hear me, Flame Dragon Lord of Mass
Destruction! I will have your head!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.880
I'm not sure.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.550
Though I do know the cage
doesn't stay full for very long.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.050
Huh?

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:48.140
Need a job, huh?

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.940
We gotta know we can trust ya,

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:53.810
so I can't give ya a job
without a letter of introduction.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.360
That's unfortunate.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:59.780
Wait, you don't know this guy, Dearia?
I thought you knew everyone.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:03.700
I can hardly be expected to know
every person on the face of the Earth.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.240
Huh?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:13.130
C-C'mon, Pip, pipe down!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.590
Well, if you insist, little guy.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:20.550
I'll make an exception for ya.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:25.350
If you're as strong and gentlemanly
as he says, then I gotta hire ya.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.680
There ain't many dragons like that around.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.770
Huh?

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:37.230
I-I'll work super hard, promise!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.490
Though please give him
a simple task to begin with.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:40.990
Oh, yeah?

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:46.950
This job would like you to
cut blocks from trees and rocks.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:49.120
JOB: Cut blocks from trees and rocks

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:49.120
PAY: Per block

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.870
Sure, but why blocks?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:54.880
Many adventurers enjoy building homes
or tools out of blocks of materials.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:57.500
It's the latest trend.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.590
Wow, that sounds cool!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.800
Okay, let's get to it!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.020
All done!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.230
What?! That's all I get paid for that?!

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:22.820
Well, yeah, it's a little side job.
Plus, the work's shoddy.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.030
If you wanna make money,
do it faster and better.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.950
This isn't enough to keep Pip fed...

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.080
Oh no, oh no, am I gonna have
to sell my tail? I could cut it off...

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.160
"Oh no, oh no..."

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.870
All right, all right, I gotchu.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.960
I'll find ya a job that
pays a little better.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.960
JOB: Hotel receptionist

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.960
and related duties

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:47.760
How do I look?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.390
Papa!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.010
Very handsome.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:54.350
This hotel seems strangely familiar...

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.640
Wait, what?

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:02.030
Whew, I'm pooped. Feel like
we walked a thousand miles.

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:04.320
Can't wait to take a shower.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.740
Welcome--

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:08.070
Run, a dragon!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:10.660
Come back!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.290
Time to pass out.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:14.250
May I take your luggage, ma'am?

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.910
Yeah, thank--

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.670
Room ser--

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:31.220
Could you please find me a different job?

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.560
Aren't you a pain in my rear.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:36.810
I wasn't gonna hurt them...

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.850
I have an idea.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:43.190
Why don't we find a job
that only you can do, Letty?

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.440
Huh?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.030
Whoa, a dragon!

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:52.120
What's a proxy service?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:54.450
JOB: Proxy service

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:54.450
PAY: Negotiable. Scales on ability

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.950
It depends on what the client needs.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:58.290
You could pretend to be someone's
boyfriend to make them look good,

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:04.550
take a dog on walks, or even be asked
to fill empty seats at a wedding.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:06.290
Congrats

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.260
Wow!

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:09.090
A wedding... that sounds fun!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.350
I don't think a dragon would be able
to work a wedding job, unfortunately.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:16.230
I wonder what kind of proxy
services they want <i>me </i>to do?

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:19.020
Are you our client?

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:23.650
Yes, sir! I'm Robert, apprentice mage!

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:31.160
A dragon in the flesh!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:35.700
I can't believe I'm seeing one
in real life! Can I dissect you?!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.370
Eep, no, no, no!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.540
Please, don't. What is it
you'd like him to do?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:44.210
Oh, right, sorry. So, uh...

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.840
I need you to pretend like I summoned you!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.090
Wait, summoned?!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:55.890
You mean like the "fwoosh, shoom,
here I am!" kind of summoned?

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.310
No way, no way, no way!

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:02.770
Oh, you don't have to do anything fancy!
Just kind of act like you were summoned!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:06.320
I promised someone I'd show them
I could summon a beast.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:14.030
Damn, you're actually
gonna summon something?

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:18.160
Let's see what kind of dumb stuff
this <i>loser </i>can summon.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.830
Very well.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.870
Come forth, my servant!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.380
Red Dragon!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:35.390
Rawr.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.140
What?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.190
He doesn't care!

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:44.770
Is someone cooking fish?

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:45.650
Smells good.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:49.400
Is that the real thing? You sure
there ain't a zipper on the back?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.030
How rude!

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:54.280
If you still doubt me,
then behold its legendary attack!

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:57.620
Go! Use Aura et Rabora!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.700
This wasn't in the contract!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.750
Aura et <i>what</i>?!

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:07.210
Oh, jeez, oh, jeez...

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.390
Wh-What on Earth...

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:28.270
You looked like you were in trouble,
so he lent you his assistance.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.860
Pip...

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:39.080
He's saying "You're too powerful and
strong to take on weaklings like them!"

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.160
Yeah, that's definitely it.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.710
We earned a lot from that!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:53.760
Typically, the more specific
the request, the higher the reward.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.180
Do you have any work that
specifically needs a dragon?

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.800
Sure do, kid.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.430
Someone needs a dragon for a magic test.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:08.980
I'd like to see if this new spell
of mine can pierce dragon scales!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.480
Thank you for agreeing to help!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.240
If your spell works, I'll be dead!

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.490
Here we go!

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:20.370
Papa's putting his life on the line
right now. Let's be patient.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:26.540
Hey there, cutie.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.750
Got a minute to chat?

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:32.250
Just kidding!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.800
My, if it isn't Lilith. It's been
decades since our last meeting.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.430
Your memory must be failing you, My Lord.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.430
Why, I'm still hardly a day over 20.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.850
Is that the look you're going for now?

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:46.190
I'd rather you didn't call it a "look."

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:49.270
When I heard there was an elf
and a dragon here in the markets,

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.820
I thought it might be you.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.980
Out house-hunting for a dragon again?

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.940
As paid work, yes.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:01.080
Shouldn't you step in and help him out?

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:05.870
I've cast a spell on him to increase
his magic defense, so he should be fine.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.960
What is it?

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.130
Oh, nothing.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:17.340
You've changed since the days when
you first became the Dark Lord.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.970
You didn't seem to care for anyone,
human or otherwise, back then.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:24.010
Ah, the days after
I'd become the Dark Lord...

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:27.140
I was a different man, then.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:33.820
That was the most unlucky day
of my entire life.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:38.650
Th-The Dark Lord has been chosen!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.920
'Tis the birth of a new Dark Lo--

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:54.960
I relinquish the title.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:55.920
Already?!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:00.010
My Lord, you have been chosen!
You cannot relinquish the title!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:13:07.260
Dark Lord Lottery

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.090
Then I must decline.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.010
You can't do that, either!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.100
I hereby render my resignation.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.100
Or that, either!

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:04.970
I abdicate.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.520
Use as many synonyms as
you want, what's done is done!

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:09.980
Are you sure you should be
selecting a Dark Lord by lottery?

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.310
It's rather crude, don't you think?

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:13.480
You need not worry about this method!

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:17.940
This lottery wheel was crafted
to pick the first-ever Dark Lord!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.570
It is the great "I Choose You Mark 8"!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:25.830
It is able to measure one's
magic ability like no other device!

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:28.120
"1st Prize: Dark Lord
2nd Prize: Vacation Package"

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.040
Sounds like there are seven
other devices that could.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.460
The mere fact that you
gave the lottery a try

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:37.250
"Dark Lord Agency"

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:37.460
I've made a grave mistake. I only came
here to pick up a book I ordered.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:33.700
means you were destined
to become the Dark Lord!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.670
Here's your participation prize.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.390
Aww, I'm not the Dark Lord? Shucks.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:45.300
May I give it a try?

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.890
Of course!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:49.730
I was seduced by those
darn pocket tissues...

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:51.690
My Lord!

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:54.940
All hail the great Dark Lord.

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:59.860
I am Lilith, a wandering fortune teller.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:04.910
Would you like to know how the
future of your reign will play out?

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.660
I'll give you a special discount.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.620
No, thank you. I have no
intention of having a reign.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.290
Huh?

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:14.670
Surely you're not willingly
giving up the title of Dark Lord.

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:17.880
Why, you'll be the ruler
of all non-human beings.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:21.550
Status, honor, and fortune are all yours!

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:25.720
I don't want any of those things.

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:28.890
Then what is it that you want?

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:29.970
Rodent Encyclopedia

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:33.850
I want to know why a ratatoskr's
overbite is so dramatic.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.930
Ratatoskr

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.560
Who would want to know that?!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.780
In any case, I think
I'll be taking my leave.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.400
Dark Lord Agency

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:56.170
Thank you all for gathering today for
the inauguration of our new Dark Lord.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:15:00.920
I, Godfrey, Grand Chamberlain
of the Dark Lord Agency,

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.170
will be your Master of Ceremonies.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.970
Now, without further ado...

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:11.640
Please welcome our Dark Lord!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:15.850
Third of His Title, Dearia Mel...

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.600
I quit

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.400
...marcean?

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:20.820
F...

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:23.860
Find the Dark Lord at once!

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.990
So this is the Dark Lord's Palace.

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:30.120
Usually they only allow tours on public
access days. What a grand opportunity.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:36.870
"The Dark Lord's Palace:
An Architectural Wonder"

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:36.750
The impregnable fortress built
by the dark arts of the first Dark Lord.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.330
I'll amuse myself with a little tour
before returning home!

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:46.880
Wherever I go, I sense ancient magic.
How very interesting.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.470
I'd fathom they're
charms against intruders.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.810
My Lord!

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:55.230
The Dark Lord must still
be within the Palace walls!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:58.150
Search every room!

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:01.110
Grand Chamberlain, look!

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:03.860
My Lord!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:06.360
Seems the charm was left unfinished.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.200
All that's missing is...

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.820
...these runes, I believe?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.790
My Lo--

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:14.040
Milo?

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:19.040
Why are we outside the Palace now?

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:24.210
Could the Dark Lord have activated
the anti-intruder charms?

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.510
My, it teleported us all the way out here?

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:29.680
No, now is not the time to be impressed!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.930
We must continue our search!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.860
Hey! Who opened the water
gates in the hallway?!

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:44.820
M-Most likely the Dark Lord, sir!

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:51.950
Hey! Who pressed the switch
to freeze the Room of Freezing?!

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.870
M-Most likely the Dark Lord, sir!

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:03.670
Hey! Who turned the heat up
in the Room of Burning?!

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:06.170
Definitely the Dark Lord, sir!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:14.350
I-If we don't find him soon,
all of our guests will go home!

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:17.980
We'll probably run out of HP first.

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:23.690
We must dispel the
anti-intruder charms, all of them!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.360
Right this instant!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:30.860
I-I don't think that's going to be easy...

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.620
Coming online.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:45.710
Ancient magic is so
incredibly fascinating.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.010
I'll have to ask my Master to
teach me more about it when I return.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.220
My Lord...

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:57.430
We've finally found you.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:02.600
Please, join us in the Grand Hall
for your ceremony...

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:11.570
Not again.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:15.950
My Lord!

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:21.790
In the end, they allowed you to leave,

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:27.630
after begging you to handle
a small bit of Dark Lord paperwork.

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:31.670
Wherever did you hear that story from?

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.930
Why, your Master, of course.

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:43.560
The only age the Dark Lord held actual sway
was during our war with humanity.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.980
Ever since the peace treaty was signed,

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:50.400
the Dark Lord has been
no more than a figurehead.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:54.860
Today, all races and
regions have autonomy,

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.490
and the Ministry of Justice
handles conflicts between them,

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:02.200
with the Ministry of Security
stepping in for emergencies.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:05.920
The Dark Lord's present duties involve
no more than appearing on posters.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.920
"Beware of scam calls!"

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:09.590
I would never bother myself
with such absurd affairs.

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:13.010
Well, aren't you talkative?

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:17.890
That black dragon changed you,
didn't he? I'm a little jealous.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:21.390
It's nothing more than a matter of
growing older. Perhaps even too old.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:24.730
Please, you look the same
as you did 1,000 years ago!

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:31.610
Seems my charge has finished
with his work. I must take my leave.

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:35.990
Oh, one thing before you go, My Lord?

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:41.910
I'm dead. I'm definitely dead.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:44.500
I'm a nice cut of roast dragon meat.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.790
It's just a little soot, that's all.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:47.830
Huh?

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.380
Why didn't it work?!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:54.380
You're right! I'm okay!

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.180
I must've leveled up!

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:58.140
Definitely not.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.050
He didn't even stop to think!

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.220
Here's your pay.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.100
Thank you very much!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:07.850
Yay! This is enough to build my own house!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.610
And to live comfortably as well.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.940
I'm going to go purchase supplies
for our continued journey.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.360
Could you go wash yourself off
at the well in the market square?

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.950
Papa!

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:20.320
Sure!

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:29.000
Much better! Thanks for waiting, Pip!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.250
Hey, you.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.630
W-Wait, me?!

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:36.130
Can I ask ya for a wee favor?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:39.680
Mind takin' a few things over
to this hut on the outskirts of town?

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:40.760
Here's a map.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.470
Oh, sorry, but I have to find my friend...

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.720
C'mon, I'll pay ya.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:46.560
Oh.

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:51.270
Humans are gathering outside town after
hearing about "a dragon in the market."

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:55.570
There are always people hoping
to capture a live dragon.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:59.700
I doubt they'll attack you within
town borders, but please be careful.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.580
I'd like to buy this, this,
and this for half-price, please.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.040
What?!

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:16.670
Dragons are such difficult creatures.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:20.380
I-I've got a delivery for you...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.220
Cool, leave 'em in that hut.

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.680
What "hut"?!

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:26.600
I-I just have to leave
them in there, right?

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.940
Hey!

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:35.940
D-Dearia!

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:06.860
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:06.900
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:06.940
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:10.240
Do you consider natural light
a housing priority?

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:12.580
Then you may be interested
in "the right to light."

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:12.620
Right to Light

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:14.960
If you live in a home with
access to good natural light,

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:20.210
and a large structure is built nearby,
you may lose access to that sunlight.

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:24.050
This loss of sunlight can lead
to negative health effects,

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:26.390
as well as make it difficult
to dry laundry.

00:23:26.390 --> 00:23:29.300
As such, many countries enforce laws
that protect this right to light

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:34.940
by limiting the size of structures
built in preexisting neighborhoods.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:34.760
Right to Light

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:37.600
This may be why many dragons
live in underground dungeons

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:42.320
or why the Dark Lord's palace
was built far from civilization.

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.020
"whoosh"

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:45.280
Though I, personally, would not
mind living in a small bungalow.

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:47.160
Next time, "A Home for Fighting."

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:47.440
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:47.480
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:48.400
Elf Housing Realty
